# Synthetic request template. Set private session/CSRF variables in your HTTP tool; never commit credentials.
# tariffId/tariffVersion come from the existing pricing API; only fixed base/flash/insurance are supported here.
@origin = http://127.0.0.1:4180
@tariffId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_TARIFF_ID
@tariffVersion = 3
@policyId = REPLACE_WITH_POLICY_RESPONSE_ID
@validFrom = REPLACE_WITH_RFC3339_START
@validUntil = REPLACE_WITH_FUTURE_RFC3339_END

### Submit as preparer; keep this key for an exact retry, change it for a new intent.
POST {{origin}}/api/ops/v1/pricing/tariffs/{{tariffId}}/policy-versions
Cookie: rf_session={{preparerSession}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{preparerCsrf}}
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_WITH_SUBMIT_OPERATION_KEY
If-Match: "{{tariffVersion}}"
Content-Type: application/json

{"validFrom":"{{validFrom}}","validUntil":"{{validUntil}}","quoteValiditySeconds":600,"serviceLevels":["S2"],"reason":"DEMO fixed-price scope only"}

### Review with a different principal, not a tariff contributor.
POST {{origin}}/api/ops/v1/pricing/policy-versions/{{policyId}}/actions/review
Cookie: rf_session={{reviewerSession}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{reviewerCsrf}}
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_WITH_REVIEW_OPERATION_KEY
If-Match: "1"
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"DEMO independently checked frozen amounts, insurance exclusion and validity"}

### Approve with a third principal.
POST {{origin}}/api/ops/v1/pricing/policy-versions/{{policyId}}/actions/publish
Cookie: rf_session={{approverSession}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{approverCsrf}}
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_WITH_PUBLISH_OPERATION_KEY
If-Match: "2"
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"DEMO approve the reviewed immutable version"}

### Read current state; published is not equivalent to a valid order quote or payment.
GET {{origin}}/api/ops/v1/pricing/policy-versions/{{policyId}}
Cookie: rf_session={{preparerSession}}
Origin: {{origin}}
